  "description": "Cross-runtime differential conformance for Trax state machines: replay a generated differential corpus through the C# engine and get back the cases it fails to reproduce. The corpus is produced by the TypeScript oracle (@trax/state-machine); this proves the two engine ports stay behaviorally identical. Framework-agnostic — returns a diff list you assert on.",
